{"aspect":"16:9","quality":"1080p","canvas":"#101718","ink":"#D6E1E2","accent":"#3E7A66","muted":"#7C8E92","brandBg":"#0A0E0F","primary":"explainer-video","skills":["explainer-video","diagram-animation","caption-animation","remotion-video","shot-composition","animation-principles","video-delivery-specs"],"coreIdea":"一则伪托苏联地下实验室的睡眠剥夺都市传说，被逐层展示后又亲手拆穿为二零一零年的虚构故事，最后把恐惧落回真实：人几天不睡就会出现幻觉。","contentLang":"zh","autoSfx":true,"scenes":[{"job":"hook","durationSec":4.248,"vo":"想象一下，五个人，一间完全密封的密室。","headline":"完全密封的密室","visualIntent":"16:9满幅：主标题“完全密封的密室”≥72px砸入，弹簧与景深；冷青灰金属墙，荧光灯闪烁，镜头缓慢推近铁门，四周留6%安全区。","keyMotion":"砸字推近","skill":"kinetic-typography","narrationFile":"vo-0.mp3","sfxCues":[{"role":"snap","intent":"enter","file":"sfx/kenney-switch-1.wav","volume":0.156,"atSec":0.04}],"sfxFile":"sfx/kenney-switch-1.wav","sfxVolume":0.156,"sfxRole":"snap"},{"job":"hook","durationSec":2.664,"vo":"整整十五天，不许睡觉。","headline":"十五天不许睡","visualIntent":"倒计时“15天”在暗绿监控噪点中跳动，眼皮特写被红线划掉，胶片颗粒，轻微手持晃动。","keyMotion":"倒计时闪烁","skill":"kinetic-typography","narrationFile":"vo-1.mp3","sfxCues":[{"role":"snap","intent":"enter","file":"sfx/iface-switch-001.ogg","volume":0.147,"atSec":0.04}],"sfxFile":"sfx/iface-switch-001.ogg","sfxVolume":0.147,"sfxRole":"snap"},{"job":"context","durationSec":5.808,"vo":"这就是“俄罗斯睡眠实验”，网上最让人毛骨悚然的都市传说之一。","headline":"俄罗斯睡眠实验","visualIntent":"伪纪录片档案标题浮现，老旧监控扫描线与胶片颗粒，低饱和青灰色，镜头轻微推近。","keyMotion":"档案浮现","skill":"caption-animation","narrationFile":"vo-2.mp3","sfxCues":[{"role":"tick","intent":"enter","file":"sfx/iface-tick-002.ogg","volume":0.129,"atSec":0.04}],"sfxFile":"sfx/iface-tick-002.ogg","sfxVolume":0.129,"sfxRole":"tick"},{"job":"setup","durationSec":6.456,"vo":"据说，上世纪四十年代，苏联研究人员把五名政治犯关进了一间气密室。","headline":"五名政治犯","visualIntent":"苏联地下实验室地图与档案转场，五个人形剪影被锁入金属气密室，冷雾弥漫，高对比阴影。","keyMotion":"剪影入锁","skill":"diagram-animation","narrationFile":"vo-3.mp3","sfxCues":[{"role":"whoosh","intent":"enter","file":"sfx/iface-maximize-001.ogg","volume":0.166,"atSec":0.04}],"sfxFile":"sfx/iface-maximize-001.ogg","sfxVolume":0.166,"sfxRole":"whoosh"},{"job":"setup","durationSec":6.072,"vo":"他们在里面释放了一种实验性气体，这种气体能彻底压制睡眠。","headline":"实验性气体","visualIntent":"管道阀门开启，实验性气体粒子扩散，青绿色雾气充满密闭空间，荧光灯闪烁，浅景深。","keyMotion":"气体扩散","skill":"diagram-animation","narrationFile":"vo-4.mp3","sfxCues":[{"role":"whoosh","intent":"enter","file":"sfx/iface-open-002.ogg","volume":0.184,"atSec":0.04}],"sfxFile":"sfx/iface-open-002.ogg","sfxVolume":0.184,"sfxRole":"whoosh"},{"job":"setup","durationSec":4.176,"vo":"条件很简单：三十天不睡，就能重获自由。","headline":"三十天换自由","visualIntent":"合同条款式字幕压入画面，铁门与钥匙剪影，冷光高对比，缓慢推近。","keyMotion":"条款压入","skill":"kinetic-typography","narrationFile":"vo-5.mp3","sfxCues":[{"role":"snap","intent":"enter","file":"sfx/iface-switch-003.ogg","volume":0.147,"atSec":0.04}],"sfxFile":"sfx/iface-switch-003.ogg","sfxVolume":0.147,"sfxRole":"snap"},{"job":"escalation","durationSec":2.736,"vo":"前五天，一切还算正常。","headline":"前五天正常","visualIntent":"监控四宫格，时间码快速跳动，前五天画面平稳但色调压抑，轻微胶片颗粒。","keyMotion":"监控快进","skill":"caption-animation","narrationFile":"vo-6.mp3","sfxCues":[{"role":"tick","intent":"enter","file":"sfx/iface-drop-001.ogg","volume":0.129,"atSec":0.04}],"sfxFile":"sfx/iface-drop-001.ogg","sfxVolume":0.129,"sfxRole":"tick"},{"job":"escalation","durationSec":2.52,"vo":"可很快，偏执出现了。","headline":"偏执出现","visualIntent":"监控画面扭曲，人物影子分裂，颗粒增强，镜头轻微手持晃动，暗绿色阴影加深。","keyMotion":"画面扭曲","skill":"caption-animation","narrationFile":"vo-7.mp3","sfxCues":[{"role":"tick","intent":"enter","file":"sfx/iface-tick-004.ogg","volume":0.129,"atSec":0.04}],"sfxFile":"sfx/iface-tick-004.ogg","sfxVolume":0.129,"sfxRole":"tick"},{"job":"escalation","durationSec":4.104,"vo":"囚犯开始对着麦克风低声说话……互相攻击。","headline":"低声与攻击","visualIntent":"音频波形从低语变为尖刺，麦克风特写，阴影中拳头剪影互相攻击，冷青色高对比。","keyMotion":"波形尖刺","skill":"chart-animation","narrationFile":"vo-8.mp3","sfxCues":[{"role":"tick","intent":"enter","file":"sfx/kenney-switch-2.wav","volume":0.138,"atSec":0.04}],"sfxFile":"sfx/kenney-switch-2.wav","sfxVolume":0.138,"sfxRole":"tick"},{"job":"escalation","durationSec":5.448,"vo":"第九天，一个人连续尖叫了三个小时……直到声带彻底损坏。","headline":"尖叫三小时","visualIntent":"持续时间轴拉到三小时，声波撕裂，声带示意图变红断裂，荧光灯闪烁，镜头推近。","keyMotion":"声波撕裂","skill":"chart-animation","narrationFile":"vo-9.mp3","sfxCues":[{"role":"tick","intent":"enter","file":"sfx/iface-tick-001.ogg","volume":0.129,"atSec":0.04}],"sfxFile":"sfx/iface-tick-001.ogg","sfxVolume":0.129,"sfxRole":"tick"},{"job":"escalation","durationSec":2.664,"vo":"然后……一切陷入死寂。","headline":"陷入死寂","visualIntent":"音频波形归零，监控雪花静止，环境音抽空，只剩荧光灯闪烁，画面陷入死寂。","keyMotion":"波形归零","skill":"caption-animation","narrationFile":"vo-10.mp3","sfxCues":[{"role":"tick","intent":"enter","file":"sfx/iface-tick-002.ogg","volume":0.129,"atSec":0.04}],"sfxFile":"sfx/iface-tick-002.ogg","sfxVolume":0.129,"sfxRole":"tick"},{"job":"climax","durationSec":2.736,"vo":"第十五天，密室被打开。","headline":"第十五天开门","visualIntent":"铁门缓慢开启，强光刺入，雾气涌出，镜头从门缝缓慢推近，青灰冷色调。","keyMotion":"铁门开启","skill":"caption-animation","narrationFile":"vo-11.mp3","sfxCues":[{"role":"tick","intent":"enter","file":"sfx/iface-drop-001.ogg","volume":0.129,"atSec":0.04}],"sfxFile":"sfx/iface-drop-001.ogg","sfxVolume":0.129,"sfxRole":"tick"},{"job":"climax","durationSec":3.408,"vo":"囚犯还活着，但他们已经不像人了。","headline":"活着却不像人","visualIntent":"监控画面中五个扭曲剪影，面部高对比阴影，皮肤灰绿，低饱和，轻微手持晃动。","keyMotion":"剪影扭曲","skill":"kinetic-typography","narrationFile":"vo-12.mp3","sfxCues":[{"role":"snap","intent":"enter","file":"sfx/iface-toggle-001.ogg","volume":0.147,"atSec":0.04}],"sfxFile":"sfx/iface-toggle-001.ogg","sfxVolume":0.147,"sfxRole":"snap"},{"job":"climax","durationSec":4.824,"vo":"最恐怖的是什么？他们竟然在乞求那种气体。","headline":"乞求那种气体","visualIntent":"手从门缝伸出抓向气体管道，画面低饱和，荧光灯闪烁，雾气贴地流动。","keyMotion":"伸手乞求","skill":"caption-animation","narrationFile":"vo-13.mp3","sfxCues":[{"role":"tick","intent":"enter","file":"sfx/iface-tick-004.ogg","volume":0.129,"atSec":0.04}],"sfxFile":"sfx/iface-tick-004.ogg","sfxVolume":0.129,"sfxRole":"tick"},{"job":"climax","durationSec":5.376,"vo":"最后，一名囚犯说：“我们，就是藏在你们每个人心里的东西……”","headline":"藏在心里","visualIntent":"引号字幕逐字浮现，囚犯眼睛特写，瞳孔里映出观众倒影，浅景深，胶片颗粒。","keyMotion":"逐字浮现","skill":"kinetic-typography","narrationFile":"vo-14.mp3","sfxCues":[{"role":"snap","intent":"enter","file":"sfx/switch.wav","volume":0.156,"atSec":0.04}],"sfxFile":"sfx/switch.wav","sfxVolume":0.156,"sfxRole":"snap"},{"job":"climax","durationSec":4.536,"vo":"那种疯狂，那种只有睡眠才能暂时压住的东西。”","headline":"睡眠压住疯狂","visualIntent":"脑部扫描图与睡眠波形对比，疯狂红线被睡眠蓝线暂时压低，冷色图表动画。","keyMotion":"波形压制","skill":"chart-animation","narrationFile":"vo-15.mp3","sfxCues":[{"role":"tick","intent":"enter","file":"sfx/iface-drop-001.ogg","volume":0.129,"atSec":0.04}],"sfxFile":"sfx/iface-drop-001.ogg","sfxVolume":0.129,"sfxRole":"tick"},{"job":"twist","durationSec":3.72,"vo":"但反转是——这个故事根本没发生过。","headline":"故事没发生","visualIntent":"画面像胶片烧穿，伪纪录片档案碎裂，标题反转，高对比阴影，暗绿余烬。","keyMotion":"胶片烧穿","skill":"kinetic-typography","narrationFile":"vo-16.mp3","sfxCues":[{"role":"snap","intent":"enter","file":"sfx/kenney-switch-1.wav","volume":0.156,"atSec":0.04}],"sfxFile":"sfx/kenney-switch-1.wav","sfxVolume":0.156,"sfxRole":"snap"},{"job":"twist","durationSec":4.872,"vo":"它只是 2010 年发布在恐怖故事网站上的虚构作品。","headline":"2010虚构作品","visualIntent":"网页窗口浮现，发布日期“2010”高亮，恐怖故事网站界面滚动，老旧监控质感。","keyMotion":"网页浮现","skill":"caption-animation","narrationFile":"vo-17.mp3","sfxCues":[{"role":"tick","intent":"enter","file":"sfx/iface-tick-002.ogg","volume":0.129,"atSec":0.04}],"sfxFile":"sfx/iface-tick-002.ogg","sfxVolume":0.129,"sfxRole":"tick"},{"job":"twist","durationSec":1.896,"vo":"没有任何证据。","headline":"没有任何证据","visualIntent":"证据链图标逐个打叉，档案空白，红色印章“无证据”，冷青灰背景。","keyMotion":"证据打叉","skill":"diagram-animation","narrationFile":"vo-18.mp3","sfxCues":[{"role":"whoosh","intent":"enter","file":"sfx/iface-maximize-001.ogg","volume":0.166,"atSec":0.04}],"sfxFile":"sfx/iface-maximize-001.ogg","sfxVolume":0.166,"sfxRole":"whoosh"},{"job":"reality","durationSec":4.2,"vo":"可即便如此，睡眠剥夺却是真实存在的。","headline":"睡眠剥夺真实","visualIntent":"从虚构网页切到医学文献与新闻剪报，冷色调，镜头缓慢推近，胶片颗粒。","keyMotion":"文献推近","skill":"caption-animation","narrationFile":"vo-19.mp3","sfxCues":[{"role":"tick","intent":"enter","file":"sfx/kenney-switch-2.wav","volume":0.138,"atSec":0.04}],"sfxFile":"sfx/kenney-switch-2.wav","sfxVolume":0.138,"sfxRole":"tick"},{"job":"reality","durationSec":3.888,"vo":"只要几天不睡，大脑就会开始出现幻觉。","headline":"几天就幻觉","visualIntent":"大脑全息图闪烁，睡眠剥夺天数轴推进，出现重影与噪点，幻觉波纹扩散。","keyMotion":"脑图闪烁","skill":"chart-animation","narrationFile":"vo-20.mp3","sfxCues":[{"role":"tick","intent":"enter","file":"sfx/iface-tick-001.ogg","volume":0.129,"atSec":0.04}],"sfxFile":"sfx/iface-tick-001.ogg","sfxVolume":0.129,"sfxRole":"tick"},{"job":"question","durationSec":3.504,"vo":"所以问题来了……你，能撑多久不睡？","headline":"你能撑多久","visualIntent":"屏幕变黑，只剩监控时间码与观众倒影，问题大字砸入，荧光灯最后闪烁。","keyMotion":"问题砸入","skill":"kinetic-typography","narrationFile":"vo-21.mp3","sfxCues":[{"role":"snap","intent":"enter","file":"sfx/iface-toggle-003.ogg","volume":0.147,"atSec":0.04},{"role":"confirm","intent":"settle","file":"sfx/iface-confirm-004.ogg","volume":0.13,"atSec":3.184}],"sfxFile":"sfx/iface-toggle-003.ogg","sfxVolume":0.147,"sfxRole":"snap"}],"captions":[{"from":0.05,"to":4.128,"text":"想象一下，五个人，\n一间完全密封的密室。"},{"from":4.298,"to":6.792,"text":"整整十五天，不许睡觉。"},{"from":6.962000000000001,"to":12.600000000000001,"text":"这就是“俄罗斯睡眠实验”，\n网上最让人毛骨悚然的都市传说之一。"},{"from":12.770000000000001,"to":19.056,"text":"据说，上世纪四十年代，\n苏联研究人员把五名政治犯关进了一间气密室。"},{"from":19.226000000000003,"to":25.128,"text":"他们在里面释放了一种实验性气体，\n这种气体能彻底压制睡眠。"},{"from":25.298000000000002,"to":29.304000000000002,"text":"条件很简单：三十天不睡，\n就能重获自由。"},{"from":29.474,"to":32.04,"text":"前五天，一切还算正常。"},{"from":32.209999999999994,"to":34.559999999999995,"text":"可很快，偏执出现了。"},{"from":34.73,"to":38.664,"text":"囚犯开始对着麦克风低\n声说话……互相攻击。"},{"from":38.833999999999996,"to":44.112,"text":"第九天，一个人连续尖叫了三个\n小时……直到声带彻底损坏。"},{"from":44.282,"to":46.775999999999996,"text":"然后……一切陷入死寂。"},{"from":46.946,"to":49.512,"text":"第十五天，密室被打开。"},{"from":49.681999999999995,"to":52.919999999999995,"text":"囚犯还活着，但他们已经不像人了。"},{"from":53.089999999999996,"to":57.744,"text":"最恐怖的是什么？他们\n竟然在乞求那种气体。"},{"from":57.913999999999994,"to":63.12,"text":"最后，一名囚犯说：“我们，\n就是藏在你们每个人心里的东西……”"},{"from":63.28999999999999,"to":67.65599999999999,"text":"那种疯狂，那种只有睡眠\n才能暂时压住的东西。”"},{"from":67.826,"to":71.37599999999999,"text":"但反转是——这个故\n事根本没发生过。"},{"from":71.54599999999999,"to":76.24799999999999,"text":"它只是 2010 年发布在\n恐怖故事网站上的虚构作品。"},{"from":76.41799999999999,"to":78.14399999999999,"text":"没有任何证据。"},{"from":78.314,"to":82.344,"text":"可即便如此，睡眠剥\n夺却是真实存在的。"},{"from":82.514,"to":86.232,"text":"只要几天不睡，大脑\n就会开始出现幻觉。"},{"from":86.402,"to":89.736,"text":"所以问题来了……你，\n能撑多久不睡？"}]}